  "Software Details": "Détails du logiciel",
  "Gone are the days of tedious, time-consuming shopping experiences. With Bundle Products, we redefine convenience by bringing together all your essential items into one comprehensive package. Whether you are looking to revamp your wardrobe, upgrade your skincare routine, or stock up on household essentials, our bundles offer everything you need in one convenient click. Say goodbye to endless scrolling and hello to streamlined shopping experiences.": "Fini le temps des expériences de magasinage fastidieuses et chronophages. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Voir la démo en direct",
  "Maximize Savings, Minimize Hassle": "Maximisez les économies, minimisez les tracas",
  "Saving money has never been easier with our Bundle Product module. By bundling products together, we unlock exclusive discounts and promotions that allow you to maximize your savings with every purchase. Why pay full price for individual items when you can enjoy significant discounts by bundling? Say goodbye to buyer is remorse and hello to smart, savvy shopping.": "Économiser de l'argent n'a jamais été aussi simple avec notre module Bundle Product. ",
  "Tailored to Perfection": "Adapté à la perfection",
  "We understand that every shopper has unique preferences and needs. That is why our Bundle Product module empowers you to customize your bundles to perfection. Mix and match your favorite products, choose your preferred sizes and colors, and create a bundle that is tailor-made just for you. Whether you are curating the perfect gift set or treating yourself to a well-deserved indulgence, our customizable options ensure that you get exactly what you want, every time.": "Nous comprenons que chaque acheteur a des préférences et des besoins uniques. ",
  "Discover Endless Possibilities": "Découvrez des possibilités infinies",
  "With Bundle Products, shopping becomes an adventure filled with endless possibilities. Each bundle presents an opportunity to explore new products, discover hidden gems, and indulge in exciting surprises. From deluxe beauty sets to curated culinary collections, our bundles offer a curated selection of products that are sure to delight and inspire. Who knows? You might just stumble upon your new favorite product with every bundle purchase.": "Avec Bundle Products, le shopping devient une aventure remplie de possibilités infinies. ",
